---
const { contained = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={["studio-commission", { contained }]} aria-labelledby="commission-title">
  <div>
    <p class="studio-kicker">A focused engineering pilot</p>
    <h2 id="commission-title">Verify one AI-built feature before release.</h2>
    <p>
      AI agents inspect one critical workflow in a TypeScript/Node application,
      run reproducible checks, and write a report of defects and verification
      limits. Sarthak is the contact for scope and payment. The pilot is $500 USD:
      $250 to start and $250 on delivery, within three
      working days after we agree the scope and runnable setup. Fixes are separately
      scoped. <a href="/evidence/feature-verification-anime-list-2026-10-02.md">Read a real sample report</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    class="studio-commission-email"
    href="mailto:team@sassmaker.com?subject=%24500%20feature%20verification%20pilot"
  >
    <span>Discuss a $500 pilot</span>
    <strong>team@sassmaker.com</strong>
    <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .studio-commission.contained { width:100%; margin:0; padding:0; gap:2rem; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(0,1fr); background:transparent; color:inherit; }
  .studio-commission.contained h2 { max-width:25ch; margin-top:.5rem; font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.5rem); line-height:1.12; }
  .studio-commission.contained > div > p:last-child { margin-top:.85rem; color:inherit; font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.6; }
  .contained .studio-commission-email { min-height:6rem; border-color:currentColor; }
  .contained .studio-commission-email > span:first-child { color:inherit; font-size:.75rem; letter-spacing:0; text-transform:none; }
  .contained .studio-commission-email > span:last-child { color:inherit; }
  @media(max-width:760px) { .studio-commission.contained { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:1rem; } }
</style>
